  "humanSetupInstructions": [
    "1. Create an Empty GameObject 'GameManager', attach 'GameManager.cs' and 'UIManager.cs'.",
    "2. Create an Empty GameObject 'PhysicsSystem', attach 'GlobalPhysicsManager.cs' and 'PhysicsManager.cs'.",
    "3. Create a 'Pusher' GameObject, add a Rigidbody (isKinematic=true), and attach 'PusherMovement.cs'.",
    "4. Assign UI elements: In 'UIManager' component, link 'scoreText', 'coinText', and 'feverSlider' to their respective TMP/Slider objects.",
    "5. Configure Prefabs: In 'CoinSpawner', assign your coin prefab to 'coinPrefab' and bumper prefab to 'bumperPrefab'."
